<title>USA: Clinton, Christopher to speak at 1415 EST.</title>
<headline>Clinton, Christopher to speak at 1415 EST.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>President Bill Clinton and Secretary of State Warren Christopher will speak in the White House Rose Garden at 2:15 p.m. EST (1915 GMT), the White House said Thursday.</p>
<p>Earlier, U.S. officials said that the two were expected to hold a news conference to confirm Christopher's resignation.</p>
